  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grant to support the &apos;Joint Programme for the</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The SD3C Programme in Senegal, implemented by IFAD aims to contribute to strenghten the food security and climate resilience of agro-pastoralist communities in the Linguere and Ran&#xe9;rou- Ferlo Departments by restoring degraded land and improving access to irrigated vegetable and fodder production systems.  The project activities will target the inclusion of between 45% and 75% women depending on the activity. The key activities include restoring 150ha of land, creating 8ha of vegetable and water access for livestock, and 12ha of fodder production.</narrative>
  </description>
